of systemic lupus erythematosus on or before a specified date. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company accounted for the Royalty Purchase Agreement as a debt financing, primarily because it has significant continuing involvement in generating the future revenue on which the royalty payments are based. The $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sEvDbHMtFEeao_rQ42TbXw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_n4xg0ww4-0ahiwRp-L0GWw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_5YlYHBQwv0iQoh-nLervqA">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million upfront payment received was recorded as a liability, net of issuance costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sEvDbHMtFEeao_rQ42TbXw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_n4xg0ww4-0ahiwRp-L0GWw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfFinancingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_XczN532PSkqBMqn4SsOIfQ">3.7</ix:nonFraction> million. The effective interest rate was determined based on the Company&#8217;s projections of future payments to Royalty Pharma. The Company will evaluate the </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;display:table;margin-bottom:30pt;min-height:27.35pt;width:100%;"><div style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:bottom;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">182</p></div></div></div>
